      "name": "Events Webhook (POST)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ],
      "notes": "يستقبل أحداث 'feed' من صفحة Facebook (تعليقات، ردود، إلخ) — نفلتر لاحقاً ما هو تعليق جديد فعلاً.",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "facebook/comments-webhook",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_respond_event_received",
      "name": "Respond - Event Received",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        400,
        380
      ],
      "notes": "رد فوري لـ Meta ثم متابعة المعالجة في الخلفية — نفس مبدأ Workflow 01.",
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "text",
        "responseBody": "EVENT_RECEIVED",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_extract_comment",
      "name": "Extract Comment Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        620,
        380
      ],
      "notes": "يتعرّف على المنصة من body.object ('page' = Facebook، 'instagram' = Instagram) ويستخرج الحقول تبعاً لذلك. is_relevant تتحقق من: الحدث تعليق فعلي، إضافة جديدة، والمُعلِّق ليس الصفحة/الحساب نفسه (لمنع حلقة لا نهائية عند الرد التلقائي). قيد مهم خاص بإنستغرام تحديداً: الرسالة الخاصة (private reply) لا يمكن إرسالها بعد مرور 7 أيام على التعليق — قيد من Meta نفسها وليس تصميماً هنا.",
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const body = $input.item.json.body;\nconst entry = body && body.entry ? body.entry[0] : undefined;\nconst change = entry && entry.changes ? entry.changes[0] : undefined;\nconst value = change ? change.value : undefined;\nconst platform = body && body.object === 'instagram' ? 'instagram' : 'facebook';\n\nlet isCommentAdd, senderId, senderName, commentId, postId, commentText, isFromSelf;\n\nif (platform === 'instagram') {\n  isCommentAdd = !!(value && change.field === 'comments');\n  senderId = value ? (value.from && value.from.id) : null;\n  senderName = value ? (value.from && value.from.username) : null;\n  commentId = value ? value.id : null;\n  postId = value ? (value.media && value.media.id) : null;\n  commentText = value ? value.text : null;\n  const igAccountId = $env.INSTAGRAM_ACCOUNT_ID;\n  isFromSelf = !!(senderId && igAccountId && senderId === igAccountId);\n} else {\n  isCommentAdd = !!(value && value.item === 'comment' && value.verb === 'add');\n  senderId = value ? (value.sender_id || (value.from && value.from.id)) : null;\n  senderName = value ? (value.sender_name || (value.from && value.from.name)) : null;\n  commentId = value ? value.comment_id : null;\n  postId = value ? value.post_id : null;\n  commentText = value ? value.message : null;\n  const pageId = $env.FACEBOOK_PAGE_ID;\n  isFromSelf = !!(senderId && pageId && senderId === pageId);\n}\n\nconst is_relevant = !!(isCommentAdd && senderId && !isFromSelf);\n\nreturn [{ json: {\n  is_relevant,\n  platform,\n  comment_id: commentId,\n  post_id: postId,\n  commenter_facebook_id: senderId,\n  commenter_name: senderName,\n  comment_text: commentText\n} }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_if_relevant",
      "name": "Is Relevant Comment?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        840,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.is_relevant}}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_noop_ignore",
      "name": "No Operation - Ignore Event",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1060,
        500
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "node_register_comment",
      "name": "Register Comment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1060,
        380
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "notes": "نرسل facebook_post_id كما هو (معرّف فيسبوك الخام) — الـ Backend هو من يربطه بمعرّف social_posts الداخلي، فلا يحتاج n8n لمعرفة ذلك التفصيل.",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.API_BASE_URL}}/facebook-comments",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.BACKEND_API_TOKEN}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"facebook_comment_id\": $json.comment_id, \"facebook_post_id\": $json.post_id, \"platform\": $json.platform, \"commenter_facebook_id\": $json.commenter_facebook_id, \"commenter_name\": $json.commenter_name, \"comment_text\": $json.comment_text } }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_reply_comment",
      "name": "Reply To Comment",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1280,
        380
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "notes": "الـ Backend يتولى فحص idempotency (نفس الشخص/نفس المنشور) وإرسال الرد الفعلي عبر Graph API — يحمل توكن الصفحة مركزياً. التوقع: {replied: true} فقط عند إرسال الرد فعلياً الآن (وليس تكراراً).",
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{$env.API_BASE_URL}}/facebook-comments/{{$('Register Comment').item.json.id}}/reply",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{$env.BACKEND_API_TOKEN}}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "value": "=fbreply-{{$('Extract Comment Data').item.json.comment_id}}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ {} }}",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_if_reply_sent",
      "name": "Was Reply Sent?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1500,
        380
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "boolean": [
            {
              "value1": "={{$json.replied}}",
              "value2": true
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "node_execute_messenger",
      "name": "Execute - Messenger Automation Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        1720,
